roying value with every dollar it reinvests, with gross margins sitting at 25%.","The business throws off $43M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 5 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 40.84\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, debt is moderate at 2.5\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, serviceable in normal conditions but worth watching through a downturn, and thin 0.9\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Management returns a meaningful 8.7% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 2.9% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Revenue growth in the bottom decile of Consumer Cyclical peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"red","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.8% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Consumer Cyclical peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Consumer demand is fundamentally cyclical \u2014 a recession compresses both unit volume and pricing power, and operating leverage cuts both ways.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 58% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 27% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Consumer Cyclical sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Precision Trading with Malibu Boats Inc. (MBUU) Risk Zones","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/134/Precision_Trading_with_Malibu_Boats_Inc._MBUU_Risk_Zones_111226104601_1794498361.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794498361.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.494,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Investors Can Find Comfort In Malibu Boats' (NASDAQ:MBUU) Earnings Quality","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/consumer-durables/nasdaq-mbuu/malibu-boats/news/investors-can-find-comfort-in-malibu-boats-nasdaqmbuu-earnin","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794479434.814,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.178,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"MBUU Q3 CY2026 deep dive: Saxdor integration offsets ski/wake softness, guidance remains cautious","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/mbuu-q3-cy2026-deep-dive-115736266.html","date":"2026-11-09","timestamp":1794225456.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.754,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","guidance"]},{"title":"Malibu Boats (MBUU) Q1 Earnings: Taking a Look at Key Metrics Versus Estimates","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3025932/malibu-boats-mbuu-q1-earnings-taking-a-look-at-